# The STM32H755ZI is a dual-core part (Cortex-M7 + Cortex-M4) and the ST
# CMSIS device header gates its peripheral instance map on either
# CORE_CM7 or CORE_CM4. RIOT targets the M7 core, so define the macro
# globally for this board.
CFLAGS += -DCORE_CM7

# load the common Makefile.include for Nucleo boards
include $(RIOTBOARD)/common/nucleo144/Makefile.include
